# Project Catalog — Consult Before Building

## Pre-build gate

Before adding a module, service, util class, admin feature area, or background job system:

1. Read [docs/shared-infrastructure.md](../../docs/shared-infrastructure.md) — check the "Do Not Build" table.
2. Read [docs/features-backend.md](../../docs/features-backend.md) and/or [docs/features-frontend.md](../../docs/features-frontend.md).
3. Confirm nothing equivalent exists. Extend existing modules instead of creating parallel systems.

Examples:
- Background work → extend `TasksModule` / `TaskTypeEnum`, not Bull/Redis queues.
- Pagination → `ShapeableQuery` + `BaseService.get()`, not custom paging.
- Admin list page → `BaseListComponent`, not a new table component.
- String/date/crypto helpers → `UtilsModule` or `common-ui/utils/`, not new util classes.

See [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) for full workflow and checklists.

## Post-build requirement

Any session that adds a feature **must** update the catalog:

| Change | Update |
|--------|--------|
| Backend module or endpoint | `docs/features-backend.md` |
| Admin UI feature or API service | `docs/features-frontend.md` |
| Reusable infra (base class, util, shared service) | `docs/shared-infrastructure.md` |
| Architectural change | `docs/architecture.md` |

Bump the **Last updated** date in each edited file. Use the entry templates at the bottom of each doc.

## Entry format

```markdown
| **Name** | `path/` | One-line description | Active |
```

Include API routes (backend) or routes + service (frontend) in the appropriate section.
